      "problem": "If $g(a,b)=(a-b)({a}^{2}-{b}^{2}),$ then $g(2,-2)=${{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "We substitute $a=2$ and $b=-2$ into the function definition and then simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}g(a,b) & =(a-b)({a}^{2}-{b}^{2}) \\\\ g(2,-2) & =((2)-(-2))((2)^{2}-(-2)^{2}) \\\\  & =(2+2)(4-4) \\\\  & =4\\cdot 0 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$",
